OL,3,ACounter-terror police lead
OL,4,Ainvestigation into major incident near
OL,5,ARAF base, officials say
OL,6,
OL,7,FA major incident has been declared near
OL,8,FRAF Fairford after several men were
OL,9,Farrested on suspicion of offences under
OL,10,Fthe Explosives Act, Gloucestershire
OL,11,Fpolice say
OL,13,FResidents in a nearby village have been
OL,14,Fevacuated to a leisure centre while
OL,15,Finvestigations continue - officers say
OL,16,Fthey believe the incident is contained
OL,18,FWhitehall officials say the
OL,19,Finvestigation into the incident is
OL,20,Fbeing led by counter-terror police, our
OL,21,Fsecurity correspondent reports
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
