OL,3,AControversial Drumcree Orange Order
OL,4,Amarch delayed as protesters block road
OL,5,
OL,6,FA controversial parade organised by
OL,7,FNorthern Ireland's Orange Order has
OL,8,Fbeen delayed as hundreds of protesters
OL,9,Fblock its route in Portadown
OL,11,FPolice have called on protesters on
OL,12,FGarvaghy Road to disperse. A mile away,
OL,13,FOrangemen - who were due to march there
OL,14,Ffor the first time in 30 years - are
OL,15,Fwaiting for the road to clear - what
OL,16,Fcould happen now?
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
