OL,3,AFour killed in helicopter crash near
OL,4,AMontreal
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn investigation into the crash is
OL,7,Fbeing led by the Major Crime Unit of
OL,8,Fthe Surete du Quebec, working alongside
OL,9,Fcrime scene technicians as well as
OL,10,Finvestigators from the Transportation
OL,11,FSafety Board of Canada.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/40
